<title>FINLAND: Finnish T-bill auction raises 942 mln markka.</title>
<headline>Finnish T-bill auction raises 942 mln markka.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result of the State Treasury Office's T-Bills auction on Tuesday compared to the October 8 auction  SUVK :</p>
<p>				This auction	Previous auction</p>
<p>				180-day T-bills   187-day T-bills</p>
<p> Av. yield, pct	   3.06 pct	    3.15 pct</p>
<p> Highest accepted	 3.06 pct	    3.15 pct</p>
<p> Lowest accepted	  3.05 pct	    3.14 pct</p>
<p> Amount, FIM million	  500		   480</p>
<p> Bids, million mk	     1,925		 2,690</p>
<p> Maturing date	    April 15, 1997    April 15, 1997</p>
<p>				This auction	Previous auction</p>
<p>				363-day T-bills   363-day T-bills</p>
<p> Av. yield, pct	   3.26 pct	    3.29 pct</p>
<p> Highest accepted	 3.27 pct	    3.29 pct</p>
<p> Lowest accepted	  3.24 pct	    3.29 pct</p>
<p> Amount, million mk	   442		   520</p>
<p> Bids, million mk	     1,372		 1,540</p>
<p> Maturing date	    Oct 15, 1997     Sept 15, 1997</p>
<p>Total planned issue amount was 1.0 billion markka. After today's auction, the outstanding amount of treasury bills is 40,862 million markka, the STO said.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-9-6805 0245</p>
